{"ID":"20240206100702-6dxjort","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240206100702-6dxjort","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206100702-6dxjort\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206100711-sl5vq33\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206100706-5n96hlz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206100711-sl5vq33\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:125,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:125\u0026#125;","title":"韭菜子（韭菜籽、韭子、韭籽）","type":"doc","updated":"20240903091630"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206100711-sl5vq33","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206100711-sl5vq33","updated":"20240206100714"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于浙江、福建、湖北、安徽、江西、广东等地。\n【性状】\t成熟种子呈扁卵形或半卵形，长24mm，宽1.53mm，表面呈黑色，一面突起，粗糙，有细密网状皱纹，另一面微凹，皱纹不显。顶端钝，基部略尖，可见一点状突起的种脐。质硬，气特异，味微辛。\n【性味】\t辛、甘，温。\n【功效】\t温补肝肾，壮阳固精，暖腰膝。用于阳痿遗精，腰膝酸痛，遗尿尿频，白浊带下。"}]},{"ID":"20240206100706-5n96hlz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206100706-5n96hlz","updated":"20240206100706"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206100706-8sl5vma.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240729161812-wjljrku","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240729161812-wjljrku","updated":"20240729162220"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 400px;","style":"width: 390px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"韭菜子"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/韭菜子-20240729161812-126b8de.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 390px;\" parent-style=\"width: 400px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 792px;","style":"width: 782px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"韭菜子 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/韭菜子 1-20240729161848-fsqdute.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 782px;\" parent-style=\"width: 792px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240729162310-i51zhtf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240729162310-i51zhtf","updated":"20240729162310"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 628px;","style":"width: 618px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"韭菜子 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/韭菜子 2-20240729162310-5kgmsyp.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 618px;\" parent-style=\"width: 628px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 629px;","style":"width: 619px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"韭菜子 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/韭菜子 3-20240729162422-2vdl8cc.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 619px;\" parent-style=\"width: 629px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240729162527-xwwn4hb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240729162527-xwwn4hb","updated":"20240729162751"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 665px;","style":"width: 655px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"韭菜子 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/韭菜子 4-20240729162527-qh2pe53.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 655px;\" parent-style=\"width: 665px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 589px;","style":"width: 579px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"韭菜子 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/韭菜子 6-20240729162751-3xfi6vh.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 579px;\" parent-style=\"width: 589px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240729162933-kmu1ojp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240729162933-kmu1ojp","updated":"20240729163010"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 610px;","style":"width: 600px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"韭菜子 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/韭菜子 8-20240729162933-wwqsrph.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 600px;\" parent-style=\"width: 610px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 648px;","style":"width: 638px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"韭菜子 (9)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/韭菜子 9-20240729163010-198vhh4.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 638px;\" parent-style=\"width: 648px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240729162658-j1h5x2i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240729162658-j1h5x2i","updated":"20240729162829"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 823px;","style":"width: 813px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"韭菜子 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/韭菜子 7-20240729162829-dgo9q3j.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 813px;\" parent-style=\"width: 823px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 467px;","style":"width: 457px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"韭菜子 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/韭菜子 5-20240729162658-27p6jq9.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 457px;\" parent-style=\"width: 467px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240729162131-bbbjroh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240729162131-bbbjroh","updated":"20240729162709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：为韭菜的种子；"}]},{"ID":"20240729162106-25iia6d","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240729162106-25iia6d"}},{"ID":"20240729162107-5gcu92a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240729162107-5gcu92a","updated":"20240903091432"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"韭菜籽"}]},{"ID":"20240903091511-qyn2i5n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903091511-qyn2i5n","updated":"20240903091517"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味：味辛；甘；性温"}]},{"ID":"20240903091533-dqaxvme","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903091533-dqaxvme","updated":"20240903091533"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经：肝；肾经"}]},{"ID":"20240903091539-tjzqyg3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903091539-tjzqyg3","updated":"20240903091548"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治：补益肝肾；壮阳固精。主肾虚阳痿；腰膝酸软；遗精；尿频；尿浊；带下清稀；"}]},{"ID":"20240903091428-8p0e916","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903091428-8p0e916","updated":"20240903091600"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"常用配方："}]},{"ID":"20240903091601-ur910ue","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903091601-ur910ue","updated":"20240903091608"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"治虚劳尿精：韭子二升，稻米三升。上二味，以水一斗七升煮如粥。取汁六升，为三服。（《千金要方》）　治失精：韭子一升，龙骨三两，赤石脂三两。凡三物以水七升，煮取二升半，分三服。（《小品方》韭子汤）\n治肾与膀胱虚冷，真气不固，小便滑数：韭子四两，舶上茴香（炒）、补骨脂（炒）、益智仁、鹿角霜、白龙骨（各）三两（煅，别研细加粉）上为细末，以青盐、鹿角胶各一两，同煮酒糊为丸，如桐子大。每服五十丸，空心温酒送下，盐汤亦得。（《魏氏家藏方》）\n治女人带下及男子肾虚冷，梦遗：韭子七升。醋煮千沸，焙，研末，炼蜜丸，梧子大。每服三十丸，空心温酒下。（《千金要方》）\n治玉茎强硬不萎，横流不住，时时如针刺，捏之则痛，其病名强中，乃肾滞漏疾也：韭子、破故纸各一两。为末，每服三钱，水一盏，煎服，日三次。（《经验方》）\n治白浊茎痛：韭菜子五钱，车前子三钱。白酒煎，露一宿，空心热服。（《同寿录》）\n治阴疝，撮痛不可忍者：韭子（炒）、芎藭。上二味等分为末，炼蜜丸如梧桐子大。每服三十丸，空心温酒下。（《圣济总录》应痛丸）治腰脚无力：韭子一升（拣净，蒸两炊久，曝干，簸去黑皮，炒黄，捣粉），安息香二大两（水煮一二百沸，慢火炒赤色）。和捣为丸，梧子大如干，人少蜜。每日空腹酒下三十丸，以饭三五匙压之。（《海上集验方》）\n治神经衰弱：韭菜子、丹参各9g，茯神、何首乌各12g，五味子6g。煎服。（《安徽中草药》）\n治顽固性呃逆：韭菜子干品或炒后研末服，每次9～15g，每日2次。（南药《中草药学》）\n治白痢、赤痢：（韭子）研末。治白痢白糖拌，治赤痢黑糖拌，陈米饮下。（姚可成《食物本草》）\n治耳聋：韭子一分（微炒），头发一分（烧灰），巴豆半分（去心皮）。上件药，用研令细，绵裹塞耳中，一日一换。（《圣惠方》）\n烟熏虫牙：瓦片煅红，安韭子数粒，清油数点，待烟起，以筒吸，引至痛处。良久，以温水漱吐。（《急救易方》）\n治小儿遗尿：韭菜子、面粉各适量，韭菜子研细和面粉制成面饼，蒸熟，日服2次。\n治腰痛脚弱：韭菜子，研粉，每服10克，开水送服。有补肾强腰之功。\n治慢性胃炎及消化性溃疡：韭菜子12克，猪肚1个。韭菜子洗净，纱布袋装好，放人猪肚内，隔水蒸至烂熟，取出药袋，取食猪肚。"}]},{"ID":"20240903091619-y5wnxjq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903091619-y5wnxjq","updated":"20240903091621"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"书籍记载："}]},{"ID":"20240903091621-p14ib9n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903091621-p14ib9n","updated":"20240903091630"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《别录》：主梦泄精，溺白(一作溺血)。\n《日华子本草》：暖腰膝。\n《滇南本草》：补肝肾，暖腰膝，兴阳道。治阳痿。\n《纲目》：补肝及命门。治小便频数，遗尿，女人白淫白带。\n《本草汇言》：通淋浊，利小水。\n《本草正》：妇人阴寒，少腹疼痛。\n姚可成《食物本草》：研末，治白痢白糖拌，赤痢黑糖拌，陈米饮下。\n《本草再新》：治筋骨疼痛，赤白带下。\n《岭南采药录》：患烂鼻渊，烧烟熏之。内服能散跌打损伤积瘀。\n《现代实用中药》：治疝痛。\n《纲目》：韭乃肝之菜，肾主闭藏，肝主疏泄。《素问》曰，足厥阴病则遗尿，思想无穷，入房太甚，发为筋痿，及为白淫，男随溲而下，女子绵绵而下。韭子之治遗精漏泄，小便频数，女人带下者，能入厥阴，补下焦肝及命门之不足。命门者藏精之府，故同治云。\n《本经逢原》：韭子，惟肾气过劳，不能收摄者为宜，若阴虚火旺及亢阳不交、独阴失合误用，是抱薪救焚矣。大抵韭之功用，全在辛温散结子则啬精，而壮火炽盛，则为戈戟。今人以韭子熏龋齿出虫，然能伤骨坏齿，不可不知。"}]},{"ID":"20240903091433-bhiakzz","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240903091433-bhiakzz"}},{"ID":"20240903091434-0dk5ilv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903091434-0dk5ilv"}}]}